# Logbook lists blocks done today and the six days before, and leaves out older, future, undated and invalid completions.
file <<END
Home:
	- Done today @done({today})
	- Six days @done({today-6})
	- Seven days @done({today-7})
	- Tomorrow done @done({today+1})
	- No date @done
	- Bad date @done(yesterday)
	- Open task
END
keys gL
see Logbook
see Today ·
see 6 days ago ·
see ✔ Done today  Home
see ✔ Six days  Home
hide Seven days
hide Tomorrow done
hide No date
hide Bad date
hide Open task
